\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"56.0\" width=\"320\" height=\"12.200000000000003\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,97.2 9.1,90.5 14.2,87.0 19.3,87.2 24.5,79.1 29.6,83.8 34.7,83.5 39.8,80.6 44.9,74.0 50.0,69.8 55.1,71.3 60.3,71.6 65.4,63.9 70.5,55.1 75.6,65.4 80.7,51.9 85.8,36.8 91.0,33.4 96.1,36.7 101.2,27.4 106.3,38.8 111.4,44.3 116.5,47.6 121.6,46.5 126.8,43.6 131.9,30.0 137.0,32.2 142.1,40.0 147.2,56.9 152.3,63.8 157.4,62.1 162.6,59.2 167.7,42.3 172.8,64.9 177.9,63.4 183.0,74.7 188.1,63.8 193.2,71.1 198.4,69.7 203.5,58.6 208.6,61.7 213.7,49.7 218.8,51.3 223.9,50.6 229.0,45.4 234.2,55.6 239.3,63.3 244.4,54.9 249.5,52.8 254.6,46.8 259.7,49.9 264.9,50.0 270.0,51.4 275.1,48.5 280.2,53.1 285.3,61.4 290.4,62.4 295.5,58.7 300.7,47.8 305.8,41.5 310.9,18.8 316.0,12.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 109.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 109.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 109.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 121.6 58.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 147.2 68.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 270.0 63.4 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 285.3 73.4 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"12.8\" r=\